    "detailed_description": "<h1>Buzz</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=560 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Kunkun Terror Express&quot; is an immersive horror adventure game that thrusts players into the heart-pounding scenario of being trapped aboard an infinite loop of the Kunkun Terror Express train. This game offers a unique blend of suspense, puzzle-solving, and survival horror.You must find a way to reach the platform  Kun and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/06ce4f356eb3ad39c0fb876933a34011.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=552 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/06ce4f356eb3ad39c0fb876933a34011.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/06ce4f356eb3ad39c0fb876933a34011.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As a player, you find yourself trapped within the confines of the Kunkun Terror Express, a mysterious train with no end in sight. Your only chance of escape lies in carefully observing the surroundings and collecting vital items scattered throughout the train. However, lurking in the shadows is the ominous presence of Kunkun himself, a relentless pursuer whose intentions are unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/6c1953b3cac2af9354bb2fbf34a6abba.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=534 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/6c1953b3cac2af9354bb2fbf34a6abba.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/6c1953b3cac2af9354bb2fbf34a6abba.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With each loop of the train, the challenges intensify, and the stakes become higher. Players must evade the pursuit of Kunkun to unravel the secrets of the Terror Express and ultimately secure their freedom.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive Horror Atmosphere: Experience a chilling atmosphere as you explore the dark and claustrophobic interiors of the Kunkun Terror Express.<br></li><li>Suspenseful Pursuit: Stay one step ahead of Kunkun as you navigate through the train, utilizing stealth and strategy to evade capture.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/198b0116eeb9ae8a8bd27d39b50140ef.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=540 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/198b0116eeb9ae8a8bd27d39b50140ef.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/198b0116eeb9ae8a8bd27d39b50140ef.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Interactive Environment: Interact with various objects aboard the train to uncover clues and progress through the game.<br></li><li>Multiple Endings: Your decisions and actions throughout the game will determine the outcome, leading to multiple possible endings to discover.</li></ul><br>Developer Notes:<br>You are free to create, upload, and monetize videos and any other content featuring Game on platforms such as YouTube, Twitch, and other video-sharing websites. The characters, places, and elements involved in the game are fictitious. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or events is purely coincidental.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=560 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Kunkun Terror Express&quot; is an immersive horror adventure game that thrusts players into the heart-pounding scenario of being trapped aboard an infinite loop of the Kunkun Terror Express train. This game offers a unique blend of suspense, puzzle-solving, and survival horror.You must find a way to reach the platform  Kun and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/06ce4f356eb3ad39c0fb876933a34011.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=552 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/06ce4f356eb3ad39c0fb876933a34011.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/06ce4f356eb3ad39c0fb876933a34011.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As a player, you find yourself trapped within the confines of the Kunkun Terror Express, a mysterious train with no end in sight. Your only chance of escape lies in carefully observing the surroundings and collecting vital items scattered throughout the train. However, lurking in the shadows is the ominous presence of Kunkun himself, a relentless pursuer whose intentions are unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/6c1953b3cac2af9354bb2fbf34a6abba.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=534 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/6c1953b3cac2af9354bb2fbf34a6abba.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/6c1953b3cac2af9354bb2fbf34a6abba.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With each loop of the train, the challenges intensify, and the stakes become higher. Players must evade the pursuit of Kunkun to unravel the secrets of the Terror Express and ultimately secure their freedom.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive Horror Atmosphere: Experience a chilling atmosphere as you explore the dark and claustrophobic interiors of the Kunkun Terror Express.<br></li><li>Suspenseful Pursuit: Stay one step ahead of Kunkun as you navigate through the train, utilizing stealth and strategy to evade capture.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/198b0116eeb9ae8a8bd27d39b50140ef.poster.avif?t=1738229115\" width=540 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/198b0116eeb9ae8a8bd27d39b50140ef.webm?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923130/extras/198b0116eeb9ae8a8bd27d39b50140ef.mp4?t=1738229115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Interactive Environment: Interact with various objects aboard the train to uncover clues and progress through the game.<br></li><li>Multiple Endings: Your decisions and actions throughout the game will determine the outcome, leading to multiple possible endings to discover.</li></ul><br>Developer Notes:<br>You are free to create, upload, and monetize videos and any other content featuring Game on platforms such as YouTube, Twitch, and other video-sharing websites. The characters, places, and elements involved in the game are fictitious. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or events is purely coincidental.",
